{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19985","headline":"新卜清罗幽居恭奉献陆大夫 · 孟郊","name":"新卜清罗幽居恭奉献陆大夫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黔娄住何处，仁邑无馁寒。\n岂悟旧羇旅，变爲新闲安。\n二顷有余食，三农行可观。\n笼禽得高巢，辙鲋还层澜。\n翳翳桑柘墟，纷纷田里欢。\n兵戈忽消散，耦耕非艰难。\n嘉木偶良酌，芳阴庇清弹。\n力农唯一事，趣世徒万端。\n静觉本相厚，动爲末所残。\n此外有余暇，锄荒出幽兰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19985.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19985","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}